"P3661695636" "Trouble from the Source"
// DetailString :
"P2550842334" "It all started when your contact, Willy 'Dealer' Wheeler, called you up about a big problem. It seems that most of Willy's jobs have originated from a source who has recently been taken captive by Arachnos forces. Willy losing his source meant no more jobs for you, so you decided to free Willy's source."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeThreeClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3475966393" "Awkward Moment"
// DetailString :
"P2405093578" "It all started when your contact, Willy 'Dealer' Wheeler, called you up about a big problem. It seems that most of Willy's jobs have originated from a source who has recently been taken captive by Arachnos forces. Willy losing his source meant no more jobs for you, so you decided to free Willy's source, a man known as Ace McKnight.<br><br>McKnight wanted Willy to find someone to take out the Arachnos agent that was coming after him - which was where you came in. Attacking the Arachnos base, it was discovered that McKnight was actually a Longbow agent that Arachnos had been tracking for months. Worst of all, Arachnos thought that you were in league with Longbow as well!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SouvenirSucker 
