"P4028393577" "I screwed up bad, {VillainName} - real bad. Arachnos agents have already been snoopin' around here askin' questions, tryin' to find that Longbow Agent McKnight. They don't know I was involved, at least not yet.<br><br>They think they've tracked down McKnight to a warehouse they suspect has been converted to a temporary Longbow base! The problem is, if they <A HREF={ACCEPT}>capture McKnight</A>, I'll be exposed as the McKnight's pawn! I'll be ruined, ya hear me? Ruined! Sure, you might get off the Arachnos radar, but I'm screwed!"
